<template><div class="page"><p class="intro">接入九张原始业务表，执行 Raw → Staging → Mart 构建，通过质量门后发布为报表数据版本。</p><div class="pipeline-flow"><div><strong>01 · 接入</strong><span>逻辑 CSV 解析、字段与业务键校验</span></div><i>→</i><div><strong>02 · 合并</strong><span>新增、更新、重复记录识别</span></div><i>→</i><div><strong>03 · 建模</strong><span>9 Raw · 4 Staging · 3 Mart</span></div><i>→</i><div><strong>04 · 发布</strong><span>粒度与金额对账、版本切换</span></div></div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>创建导入批次</h2><small>新增时间段或重叠快照均可导入</small></div><div class="import-controls"><label>合并模式<select v-model="mergeMode" aria-label="合并模式"><option value="append_only">仅追加（不覆盖已有记录）</option><option value="upsert">快照更新（需源快照时间）</option></select></label><label v-if="mergeMode==='upsert'">源快照时间<input v-model="snapshotAt" aria-label="源快照时间" placeholder="2026-10-03T10:00:00+08:00"></label></div><p class="footnote">快照时间指上游数据提取时间，不是订单购买月份；缺行或空值不表示删除。</p><div class="import-controls"><label class="grow">服务器本地源目录<input v-model="directory" aria-label="源数据目录" placeholder="包含九张 CSV 的目录"></label><label>批次名称<input v-model="label" placeholder="例如：2018 年业务数据"></label><button :disabled="busy" @click="local">校验目录</button></div><div class="upload-controls"><input ref="input" type="file" accept=".csv" multiple aria-label="选择九个原始 CSV" @change="selectFiles"><button class="secondary" :disabled="busy||files.length!==9" @click="upload">上传并校验 {{files.length?`（${files.length} 文件）`:''}}</button><span class="muted">或直接上传九张标准命名的原始 CSV</span></div><details><summary>源文件与合并规则</summary><div class="two-col"><ul class="file-list"><li v-for="file in state.meta?.files" :key="file">{{file}}</li></ul><p class="footnote">订单、商品项、支付、客户、商品、卖家及翻译按业务键合并；地理位置和评价按完整记录匹配，保留源数据重复次数。输入中没有出现的历史记录继续保留；订单身份冲突与状态回退会阻止发布。只包含表头的空增量文件可以接收。</p></div></details></section><div v-if="error" class="error">{{error}}</div><div v-if="connectionError" class="error">{{connectionError}} <button class="secondary" @click="load">重试连接</button></div><div class="two-col batch-layout"><section class="panel"><h2>导入批次</h2><div v-if="!batches.length" class="empty">尚未创建导入批次。</div><button v-for="batch in batches" :key="batch.id" :class="['batch-row',selected===batch.id?'selected':'']" @click="selected=batch.id"><div><b>{{batch.label}}</b><small>{{new Date(batch.created_at).toLocaleString()}}</small></div><span :class="['badge',batch.status]">{{status[batch.status] || batch.status}}</span></button></section><section class="panel" v-if="current"><div class="panel-title"><h2>{{current.label}}</h2><span :class="['badge',current.status]">{{status[current.status] || current.status}}</span></div><p class="muted">{{current.phase}}</p><progress max="100" :value="current.progress"></progress><div v-if="current.error" class="error">{{current.error}}</div><div class="actions"><button v-if="current.status==='ready'" :disabled="busy" @click="execute">合并、构建并发布</button><button v-if="current.status==='published' && state.meta?.version?.batch_id===current.id" class="secondary" @click="undo">恢复上一数据版本</button></div><p class="footnote">批次 {{current.id}} · 候选构建与正式库隔离。失败任务的候选库和源文件快照保留供排查。</p><details v-if="current.events?.length"><summary>查看执行记录</summary><ol class="events"><li v-for="(e,i) in current.events" :key="i">{{e.phase}} <small>{{new Date(e.at).toLocaleTimeString()}}</small></li></ol></details></section><section v-else class="panel empty">选择批次查看校验和执行结果。</section></div><section class="panel" v-if="current?.profile"><h2>源文件校验</h2><table><thead><tr><th>源表</th><th>逻辑记录数</th><th>重复记录</th><th>冲突记录</th><th>无效记录</th><th>购买时间范围</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="f in current.profile.files" :key="f.table"><td>{{f.table}}</td><td>{{number(f.rows)}}</td><td>{{number(f.duplicates)}}</td><td>{{number(f.conflicts)}}</td><td :class="f.invalid_rows?'negative':''">{{number(f.invalid_rows)}}</td><td>{{f.min_date?`${f.min_date.slice(0,10)} — ${f.max_date.slice(0,10)}`:'—'}}</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="error" v-if="current.profile.errors?.length"><div v-for="(e,i) in current.profile.errors" :key="i">{{e.file}} · 逻辑行 {{e.row || '表头'}}：{{e.reason}}</div></div></section><section class="panel" v-if="current?.merge?.length"><h2>增量合并结果</h2><table><thead><tr><th>源表</th><th>新增</th><th>更新</th><th>已有／重复</th><th>合并后行数</th><th>合并方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="m in current.merge" :key="m.table"><td>{{m.table}}</td><td>{{number(m.inserted)}}</td><td>{{number(m.updated)}}</td><td>{{number(m.unchanged)}}</td><td>{{number(m.total)}}</td><td>{{m.mode}}</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class="panel" v-if="current?.checks?.length"><h2>质量门结果</h2><div class="checks-grid"><div v-for="c in current.checks" :key="c.name" class="check"><span :class="['badge',c.status]">{{c.status}}</span><div><b>{{c.name}}</b><small>实际 {{c.actual}} / 预期 {{c.expected}}</small></div></div></div><p class="footnote">FAIL 阻止发布；WARNING 保留可解释的源数据缺失或异常，并记录数量。</p></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>旧导入字符修复</h2><small>源CSV证据限定，不替代快照更新</small></div><p class="footnote">使用上方源目录的完整卖家CSV，检查旧反斜杠+r被解释为回车的差异；其他业务键或字段变化拒绝修复。修复会克隆三层并保存完整上一版，数据不发送给模型。</p><button class="secondary" :disabled="busy||!directory" @click="previewRepair">预览源字符差异</button><div v-if="repairPlan"><p>{{repairPlan.changes.length}} 个卖家存在可追溯的旧字符差异。</p><ul><li v-for="(n,t) in repairPlan.impacts" :key="t">{{t}}：{{number(n)}} 行</li></ul><p class="footnote">源文件SHA-256：{{repairPlan.source_sha256}}</p><pre class="sql-block">{{JSON.stringify(repairPlan.changes,null,2)}}</pre><button v-if="repairPlan.ready" :disabled="busy" @click="repairText">确认修复并保留完整前版</button><p v-else class="footnote">当前没有需要修复的旧转义差异。</p></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>备份保留管理</h2><small>保留最近三份备份，并额外保护当前版本的上一版</small></div><button class="secondary" :disabled="busy" @click="previewCleanup">预览可清理备份</button><div v-if="cleanup"><p class="footnote">{{cleanup.targets.length}} 个旧备份可清理；正式库、当前上一版、失败候选库及源文件不会删除。</p><ul><li v-for="t in cleanup.targets" :key="t.schema">{{t.schema}} · {{t.tables.length}} 张表</li></ul><button v-if="cleanup.targets.length" :disabled="busy" @click="cleanBackups">确认删除列出的旧备份</button></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>已发布数据层</h2><small>{{state.meta?.version?`批次 ${state.meta.version.batch_id}`:'现有数据库'}}</small></div><div class="three-col"><div v-for="layer in ['raw','stg','mart']" :key="layer"><h3>{{{raw:'Raw · 原始业务粒度',stg:'Staging · 去重与聚合',mart:'Mart · 报表业务粒度'}[layer]}}</h3><div v-for="t in state.meta?.tables?.filter((t:any)=>t.layer===layer)" :key="t.table" class="table-count"><span>{{t.table}}</span><b>{{number(t.rows)}}</b><a v-if="layer==='mart'" :href="`/api/exports/${t.table}`">CSV</a></div></div></div></section></div></template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref,computed,onMounted,onBeforeUnmount,watch} from 'vue'
import {state,api,post,number,refreshMeta} from '../state'
import {askConfirmation} from '../confirmation'
const directory=ref(''),label=ref(''),files=ref<File[]>([]),batches=ref<any[]>([]),selected=ref(''),error=ref(''),busy=ref(false),input=ref<HTMLInputElement>();const mergeMode=ref('append_only'),snapshotAt=ref(''),connectionError=ref(''),cleanup=ref<any>(null);let timer:any;let lastVersion='';let loading=false
const status:any={queued:'等待校验',uploading:'上传中',validating:'校验中',ready:'待构建',invalid:'校验未通过',building:'构建中',published:'已发布',unchanged:'未变化',failed:'失败',interrupted:'已中断',rolled_back:'已回滚'}
const current=computed(()=>batches.value.find(b=>b.id===selected.value)),repairPlan=ref<any>(null)
watch(()=>state.meta?.source_dir,v=>{if(!directory.value&&v)directory.value=v},{immediate:true})
async function load(){if(loading)return;loading=true;try{batches.value=await api('/api/imports');connectionError.value='';if(!selected.value&&batches.value.length)selected.value=batches.value[0].id;const published=batches.value.find(b=>b.status==='published')?.id || '';if(published && published!==lastVersion){lastVersion=published;await refreshMeta()}}catch(e:any){connectionError.value=e.message}finally{loading=false}}
async function task(fn:()=>Promise<any>){busy.value=true;error.value='';try{await fn();await load()}catch(e:any){error.value=e.message}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function local(){await task(async()=>{const b=await post('/api/imports/local',{directory:directory.value,label:label.value,merge_mode:mergeMode.value,snapshot_at:mergeMode.value==='upsert'?snapshotAt.value:null});selected.value=b.id})}
function selectFiles(event:Event){files.value=Array.from((event.target as HTMLInputElement).files || [])}
async function upload(){await task(async()=>{const b=await post('/api/imports/upload',{filenames:files.value.map(f=>f.name),label:label.value,merge_mode:mergeMode.value,snapshot_at:mergeMode.value==='upsert'?snapshotAt.value:null});selected.value=b.id;for(const file of files.value){await api(`/api/imports/${b.id}/files/${encodeURIComponent(file.name)}`,{method:'PUT',body:file,headers:{'Content-Type':'application/octet-stream'}})}await post(`/api/imports/${b.id}/validate`);})}
async function execute(){await task(()=>post(`/api/imports/${selected.value}/execute`))}
async function undo(){if(!await askConfirmation('恢复上一版 Raw / Staging / Mart？当前发布版会保留在恢复库中。'))return;await task(async()=>{await post(`/api/imports/${selected.value}/rollback`);await refreshMeta()})}
async function previewCleanup(){await task(async()=>{cleanup.value=await api('/api/maintenance/backups?keep=3')})}
async function previewRepair(){await task(async()=>{repairPlan.value=await post('/api/maintenance/source-text/preview',{directory:directory.value})})}
async function repairText(){if(!repairPlan.value||!await askConfirmation('确认按源CSV修复列出的城市转义差异？将验证完整三层候选并保留完整上一版。'))return;await task(async()=>{const r=await post('/api/maintenance/source-text/repair',{directory:directory.value,token:repairPlan.value.token,confirmed:true});selected.value=r.id;repairPlan.value=null})}
async function cleanBackups(){if(!cleanup.value||!await askConfirmation('永久删除以下备份，无法恢复：\n'+cleanup.value.targets.map((t:any)=>t.schema).join('\n')))return;await task(async()=>{await post('/api/maintenance/backups/prune',{keep:3,token:cleanup.value.token,confirmed_schemas:cleanup.value.targets.map((t:any)=>t.schema)});cleanup.value=null})}
function refresh(){load()}
onMounted(()=>{load();timer=setInterval(load,3000);window.addEventListener('olist-refresh',refresh)});onBeforeUnmount(()=>{clearInterval(timer);window.removeEventListener('olist-refresh',refresh)})
</script>
